Vendored source (pystripe)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/flamingo_stitcher/_pystripe_core.py contains the stripe-removal core
(`filter_streaks` and its private helpers) copied verbatim from pystripe 1.3.1
(https://github.com/chunglabmit/pystripe) so destriping depends only on
numpy/scipy/pywt/scikit-image and survives PyInstaller bundling. pystripe is:

